        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DETEX F90Rx8 8 Foot Fire Rated Mullion</b>\r\n<p>\r\n 8 Foot Fire Rated Mullion for use <a href=\"/products/delayed-egress-panic-device-detex-fv40ee-36\">DETEX FV40EE-36 Delayed Egress Panic Device</a>,  <a href=\"/products/alarm-rim-device-detex-v40eb62836\">DETEX V40EB62836 Alarm Rim Device</a> and other <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\">Rim Panic Devices</a> on pairs of doors. Field sizable- Can be cut for shorter frames. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: For shorter doors, <a href=\"/products/7-foot-mullion-fire-rated-detex-f90rx7\"><b>DETEX 7 foot Mullion</a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMullion can be removed in minutes by removing 6 easily accessible screws. Removal of top fitting screws allows tube and fitting to rotate away from frame. Small profile base plate prevents interference when moving objects through doorway. Base and anchors included.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for DETEX F90Rx8 8 Foot Mullion\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Height: 8 Feet Tall Doors</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/4” thick, 2\" x 3\" steel mullion tube</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for 3 Hr Fire Doors</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Limited Manufacturer Warranty </li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/F90R-install.pdf?v=1704262420\"><b>DETEX F90Rx8 installation Instructions</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>** Made to order item. Please allow 3 weeks to ship</b>\r\n</p>",
